				\begin{document}$$3/2^ +$$\end{document}</tex-math><mml:math id="M70"><mml:mn>3</mml:mn><mml:mo>&#x02215;</mml:mo><mml:msup><mml:mrow><mml:mn>2</mml:mn></mml:mrow><mml:mrow><mml:mo>+</mml:mo></mml:mrow></mml:msup></mml:math><inline-graphic xlink:href="41467_2018_8052_Article_IEq34.gif"/></alternatives></inline-formula>resonance even in a purely s-wave picture of the reaction. When also the <inline-formula id="IEq35"><alternatives><tex-math id="M71">\documentclass[12pt]{minimal}
				\usepackage{amsmath}
